    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROYAL GWENT HOSPITAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Royal Gwent Hospital is the setting where Dr. Sophia Patel encounters Tingju Zhu, highlighting their professional environment."</data>
